OL,5,G0600 James Martin's French Adventure
OL,6,     FThe chef travels through France to
OL,7,     Fvisit the locations that inspired
OL,8,     Fhis culinary career, beginning at
OL,9,     Fthe Chateau Cheval Blanc in
OL,10,     FSaint-Emilion, before going back
OL,11,     Fto the kitchens of the Hostellerie
OL,12,     Fde Plaisance, where he worked as a
OL,13,     Flad more than 30 years ago. He
OL,14,     Frounds off his trip by cooking at
OL,15,     Fan award-winning vineyard
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG1/14
