OL,5,G0630 James Martin's American Adventure
OL,6,     FThe chef ends his coast-to-coast
OL,7,     Fexploration of the US in New York
OL,8,     FCity. After a bite of pizza at a
OL,9,     Fpopular pizzeria in Greenwich
OL,10,     FVillage, James cooks on one of the
OL,11,     Fcity's famous piers. New York has
OL,12,     Fa wealth of French fine-dining
OL,13,     Frestaurants, and the chef cannot
OL,14,     Fwait to take a bite of the action.
OL,15,     FHe chooses his favourite pair,
OL,16,     FDaniel, run by his old mate Daniel
OL,17,     FBoulud, and Le Bernadine, where
OL,18,     FEric Ripart is in charge. At the
OL,19,     Fend of the day, James cooks back
OL,20,     Fon the pier as sunset approaches
OL,21,     Fand he reminisces on his journey
OL,22,     Fof more than 3,000 miles
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG2/14
