OL,5,G1340 Nations Championship
OL,6,     FWales v New Zealand (Kick-off
OL,7,     F2.10pm). Lauren Salter presents
OL,8,     Fcoverage of the Northern
OL,9,     FHemisphere Series match at
OL,10,     FPrincipality Stadium in Cardiff.
OL,11,     FWales have not defeated the All
OL,12,     FBlacks since 1953, with New
OL,13,     FZealand winning 34 consecutive
OL,14,     Fmatches against them since then.
OL,15,     FThe last meeting between the sides
OL,16,     Fcame here 12 months ago, when the
OL,17,     Fvisitors scored seven tries in a
OL,18,     F52-26 triumph. Commentary comes
OL,19,     Ffrom Gareth Rhys Owen, Shane
OL,20,     FWilliams, and Jamie Roberts, with
OL,21,     Fanalysis by Sean Fitzpatrick, Sam
OL,22,     FWarburton, and Dan Biggar
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG6/14
