OL,5,G1630 Nations Championship
OL,6,     FEngland v Japan (Kick-off 4.40pm).
OL,7,     FMark Pougatch presents all the
OL,8,     Faction from the Northern
OL,9,     FHemisphere Series match at Allianz
OL,10,     FStadium Twickenham. England have
OL,11,     Fwon all six of the previous
OL,12,     Fmeetings between the nations,
OL,13,     Fincluding a comfortable 59-14
OL,14,     Fvictory here when the sides last
OL,15,     Ffaced each other two years ago,
OL,16,     Fand they will expect to maintain
OL,17,     Fthat 100 per cent record today.
OL,18,     FWith commentary by Nick Mullins
OL,19,     Fand David Flatman, analysis from
OL,20,     FUgo Monye and Maggie Alphonsi, and
OL,21,     Freports by Topsy Ojo
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG7/14
